  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A rank six female Gu Immortal walks out from behind the hall once the guests accept the alliance conditions, and they greet her by name.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She wears an embroidered leather skirt characteristic of Northern Plains women, embroidered with purplish-red flower buds, with edges glittering with silvery light. She binds her hair with a sapphire blue ribbon that has a pure white pearl inlaid in the middle. Her eyes droop and emphasize her thick eyelashes. Her hands are as white as snow. She looks youthful and beautiful.",
      "chapters": [
        660
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is dressed in a bright leather dress, silver at the bottom, with images of the grassland in the night sky with the moon on it. She wears a precious pearl headband.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "third-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng greets her as senior Fairy Li Shan. She is an influential Northern Plains Gu Immortal at rank seven, youthful in look but older than Tai Bai Yun Sheng. Hei Lou Lan addresses her as little aunt, and Fairy Li Shan treats that tie as a secret outsiders do not know.",
      "chapters": [
        660
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She owns the third branch peak of Snowy Mountain blessed land and is called its third leader. Snowy Mountain is the largest demonic path nest in Northern Plains, so she is a demonic path Gu Immortal despite a gentle public manner.",
      "chapters": [
        660
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_snowy_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is also famous beyond that nest: third leader on one hand, and a figure with wide dealings among Northern Plains righteous path Gu Immortals on the other.",
      "chapters": [
        664
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She holds Mountain Pledge Gu, a rank six information path Immortal Gu as famous as sea oath Gu. An oath pledged to a mountain cannot be broken while that mountain still exists, and she uses it when Fang Yuan, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and Hei Lou Lan form the Snowy Mountain alliance on that peak.",
      "chapters": [
        660
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_mountain_pledge_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_sea_oath_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_snowy_mountain_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mountain Pledge Gu is also why she is widely trusted: Dong Fang Chang Fan needed it for a righteous alliance, and Snowy Mountain itself rests on pledges that demonic path Gu Immortals cannot break. Fang Yuan values the alliance for her wide connections and information reach as much as for battle support.",
      "chapters": [
        664
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She later sells Fang Yuan the ancient recipe for group strength Gu, saying she had originally planned to give that Gu to Hei Lou Lan and is selling it because stone monkey fur has reappeared on the market.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-alliance-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_group_strength_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan tightens a new agreement with her side, even her information path quasi-great grandmaster attainment would need several years to break it.",
      "chapters": [
        975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "new-agreement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fight at Yi Tian Mountain, immortal zombie Bo Qing’s sword light cuts off her head. Tai Bai Yun Sheng activates man as before Immortal Gu and restores her, then Bo Qing’s sword qi bursts from her body and turns her into mushy flesh while Hei Lou Lan cries out for her little aunt.",
      "chapters": [
        1011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_bo_qing",
        "gu_man_as_before_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In that battle Hei Lou Lan’s aunts, Blazing Heaven Demoness and Fairy Li Shan, die one after the other, and Shadow Sect is the culprit.",
      "chapters": [
        1031
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "culprit-after-yi-tian-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
